l\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\">Chunks recalled without help (0–5):</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"number\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-recalled\" min=\"0\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\"><label class=\"practice-label\" for=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\">A recurring error to work on:</label><input class=\"text \" type=\"text\" id=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\" data-save=\"chunk-v1-baseline-errors\"><p id=\"weekly-comparison\" role=\"status\"></p></div>"
